<title>MALAYSIA: Hong Leong Properties year net up 62 pct.</title>
<headline>Hong Leong Properties year net up 62 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 127.92   vs	  79.13</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 18.3    vs	  11.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   642.20   vs	 454.45</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   166.16   vs	 106.23</p>
<p>    Minorities		   1.48   vs	   0.91</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries    loss 16.83   vs	   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of company is Hong Leong Properties Bhd, a member of the Hong Leong Group Malaysia.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
